# Build context whitelist shared by every Go service image (WP18). BuildKit
# reads <name>.Dockerfile.dockerignore next to each Dockerfile; the five
# files are identical copies (infra/lib/images.mjs checks that they match).
# The context is the repo root, so ignore everything and let back only what
# a Go build needs: the workspace, the Go modules it lists, the prebuilt
# worldgen.wasm (built once on the host so the zone runs the exact bytes the
# client ships) and the two contract files services read at runtime.
*
!go.work
!server/
!tools/bots/
!tools/creator/server/
!worldgen/harness/go/
!worldgen/pkg/worldgen.wasm
!worldgen/pkg/manifest.json
!worldgen/archive/
!contracts/migrations/
!contracts/worldspec.schema.json
**/node_modules
**/bin
